**Bottom line:** 3 of 6 experiments (6.2 Personhood, 6.5 Evolutionary, 6.6 Watchers) fully pass all gate criteria. Two experiments (6.1 JAM, 6.4 Vitality) pass 4/5 but each need a real feature flag to match their documented intent. One experiment (6.3 Visionary bets) has no implementation evidence yet.
